\\name{set4}
\\alias{set4}
\\title{Information Criteria, Residual Diagnostics, and GARCH}
\\description{
Compare ARIMA models with log-likelihood, AIC, BIC, and FPE; inspect residual plots; apply Ljung-Box and ARCH LM tests; and conditionally fit a GARCH(1,1) model.
}
\\usage{
set4()
}
\\value{
A character string containing the practical R code.
}
\\details{
This topic is part of the \\pkg{tspracticals} practical-code reference. Use
\\code{cat(set4(), sep = "\\n")} to print the code for copying, or call
\\code{set4()} to retrieve it as a character string.
}
\\examples{
cat(set4(), sep = "\\n")
}
